{
 "about": "Shared payload corpus. Each case applies its edits to a base payload (meta.data.json, prices.data.json or eda.data.json in this folder) and states whether the result is valid. tests/test_payload_corpus.py runs every case through Python's validate_meta/validate_prices/validate_eda, and src/lib/contract.payloads.corpus.test.ts runs the same cases through parseMeta/parsePrices/parseEda, so the two readers cannot disagree on any of them. An edit is {path, value} or {path, delete: true}; value is written as JSON, so 4.0 stays a float for Python while JavaScript reads the number 4.",
